      "message": "[error] Line 21: 🔴 Installing `stable` through `curl | sh` makes the Linux packaging image non-reproducible: future rebuilds of the same Dockerfile can silently pick up a different Rust/Cargo version and produce different package results or new build failures. Pin the Rust toolchain to the minimum tested version required by `yffi` (for example `--default-toolchain 1.xx.x`) and update it deliberately when needed.",
