      "message": "[error] Line 23: 🔴 `chmod -R a+rwX /usr/local/rustup /usr/local/cargo` makes the system Rust toolchain world-writable, so the unprivileged package build user or any build script can overwrite `cargo`/`rustc` for later build steps. The build user only needs to execute the installed toolchain; keep it read/execute-only (`chmod -R a+rX`) and, if Cargo needs a writable cache, point `CARGO_HOME` or build cache directories to a per-user writable location instead of making the toolchain mutable.",
